bin/
# Rooted: hack/continuity and hack/deployloop are source. Unrooted patterns
# would ignore the sources along with the binaries built beside them.
/continuity
/deployloop
# `go build ./cmd/boxd` from the root drops the binary here; history was
# rewritten once already to purge committed binaries (#10).
/boxd
/box
/boxgate
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
web/node_modules/
# The bundle is generated (`go generate ./web`), never committed: a minified
# blob in every diff was unreviewable and conflicted between any two branches
# that touched web/src. go:embed reads it at build time.
web/dist/
hack/room-smoke/node_modules/
hack/room-smoke/package*.json

# Dogfood: the factory's own state (store, mirrors, workspaces, logs).
# The HARNESS that produces it is tracked, in hack/dogfood.
.factory/
__pycache__/
